fix printk warning

Reported-by: kernel test robot <lkp@intel.com>
  Link: https://lkml.kernel.org/r/202302021325.700zGa0M-lkp@intel.com
Cc: Kuan-Ying Lee <Kuan-Ying.Lee@mediatek.com>
Cc: Andrey Konovalov <andreyknvl@gmail.com>
